# Entries here are deleted from the clone before the build runs, so nothing
# under react-app/ may be listed -- that is the Root Directory Vercel builds.
#
# Patterns match at every depth, so the root-only exclusions are anchored with
# a leading slash. An unanchored *.xlsx would also strip the demo data in
# react-app/public-vercel/ and deploy an app with nothing in it.

/pipeline
node_modules
/data
/*.xlsx
/*.docx
/*.pptx
/*.md
/*.csv
/replenishment-cockpit-prototype.html
/replenishment-cockpit-v2.html
/replenishment-cockpit-v3.html
/replenishment-cockpit-v4.html
/replenishment-cockpit-v5.html
/replenishment-ai-platform.html
